                        <div class="card-content">
                          <h3 class="vehicle-name">Toyota Supra mk5</h3>
                          <p class="vehicle-description">The Supra is powered by two BMW-sourced engine options: 
                            a turbocharged B48 2.0-litre inline-four or a turbocharged B58 3.0-litre inline-six. The 2.0-litre engine was 
                            initially offered in Japan, select Asian countries and Europe. One of the most notable aspects of the 2020 
                            GR Supra is its acceleration. With a 3.0-L Turbo Inline-6 engine, the car can go from 0-60 mph in just 3.8 seconds. 
                            This makes it the fastest supra in the world.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
